# Raw solver output of the study's runs (tens of MB, reproducible bit for bit
# from cases/<name>/deck with build/bin/sparlab_form; the explicit *_x05 cases
# need a build of commit 7d571e6, where form_explicit still exists); the evaluated surfaces
# (surfaces/*.npz), summaries, tool forces, decks and logs are kept.
cases/*/output/*_nodes.csv
cases/*/output/*_elements.csv
cases/*/output/mesh.json
cases/*.claim/
__pycache__/
